{"id":"afc30501f405cff5","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md","title":"ZFC Recursion2 Total Computable Map","display":"df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map — ZFC Recursion2 Total Computable Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map — ZFC Recursion2 Total Computable Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map — ZFC Recursion2 Total Computable Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"278f83d281480a6e\" href=\"?note=278f83d281480a6e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\">\\(f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S\\)</span> (partial-computable-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"278f83d281480a6e\" href=\"?note=278f83d281480a6e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}total\\text{-}computable\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(f)\\land \\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}total\\text{-}computable\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(f)\\land \\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A unary partial computable graph is total precisely when its domain is all of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>; its codomain is already fixed as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> by the upstream predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map","status":"resolved","id":"278f83d281480a6e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map","status":"resolved","id":"278f83d281480a6e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S$ (partial-computable-map predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-recursion2-partial-computable-map]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}total\\text{-}computable\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PartialComputableMap}_S(f)\\land \\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1158,"backlinks":[{"id":"37437e63af9f668e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md]])"},{"id":"e733fe56d69651f6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"beda15b0668c707f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md]])"},{"id":"db7e04769cfcd66e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S\\subseteq V$ and $\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md]], [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3239","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md|58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","278f83d281480a6e","36d7463d215be751"]}